This project's main feature is making copy of your local files in Google Drive

Use cases:
1. backupmanager configure <SET GOOGLE API TOKEN HERE>
2. backupmanager upload ./some-file.mp4
3. backupmanager download ./some-file.mp4
4. backupmanager activities

cleanup scenarios:
-> close file when we fully read it
background processes:
-> show all our active downloads and uploads